    "colloquialNames": "",
    "description": "<p>The Ring Collector is a creature gifted with supernatural strength and speed who is obsessed with finding and collecting magic rings. They invaded and wiped out several villages during the Necromancer War in pursuit of rings. The Ring Collector is Craelin’s advisor, Namlin. Namlin stayed loyal to the archmage after he became a nercromancer even after all others left Craelin’s side. As a gift, Craelin warped Namlin’s flesh and turned them into a hunter of magic rings, ones meant to eventually adorn the necromancer’s fingers. Namlin became too covetous of their rings and refused to give them over to Craelin. The necromancer stripped the Ring Collector of their collection and imprisoned them in this crystal for insolence a short time before disappearing.</p>",
    "secrets": "",
    "source": "Crows Playtest 2, The Ref Book"
  },
